          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kinyo Jepta Mispa ole mi gonnyi, ak ogeero, kimong’ cheptanyi kotorok inendet kotinyei sugutisiek che mengechen kotienonu: ki lakwennyi noto inegei; kima kotinyei werit anan chepto age kobate noto inegei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogeer inendet, kobet ngoroikyik, ak kole, Bwa cheptanyu! Kegona anyeratit, ak i age eng’ che inyalila: amu koang’ang’ji Jehovah kutinnyu, ama aweechige let.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
