            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji lakwanato inendet, Baba, koing’ang’ji kuting’ung’ Jehovah; yaiywa ko u kit ne kobun kuting’ung’; amu kogoyaaktaun Jehovah mugetut eng’ buniguk, eng’ lagokab Amon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kilenji kwandanyi, Ingeyaiywa ng’olyondoni: chamwa atebi anege arawek aeng’, si kobiit awa tulonok barak, arirji bergeinatennyu, ane, ak choronokyuk. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kile, Ui. Ak kilenji kwo arawek aeng’: kiwa anyun, inendet ak choronokyik, ak korirji bergeinatennyi eng’ tolonok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kingogesgei arawek aeng’u, koweektagei ole mi kwandanyi, ak kiyachi inendet ko u kaarortaennyi ne kiga koaror: ak kitomo kotuiyo ak muren. Ak kiek biteet eng’ Israel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kele, bendi tibikab Israel kenyit age tugul koyaei kabwatet agobo cheptab Jepta Gileadindet eng’ betusiek ang’wan eng’ kenyit age tugul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.11.40"
            ]
          }
        }
